msgstr "Un'unica fonte di verità"

#: index.md:23
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Every packages uses the official Instructure design tokens, components, and "
"interactions from <a href=\"https://instructure.design\" "
"target=\"_blank\">InstUI</a>."
msgstr ""

#: index.md:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the smallest package"
msgstr "Usa il pacchetto più piccolo"

#: index.md:28
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Install just <code>@pantoken/css</code> for a stylesheet, <code>@pantoken/"
"pendo</code> for guides, or a bundler preset for Tailwind, Panda, or MUI."
msgstr ""
"Installa solo @pantoken/css per un foglio di stile, @pantoken/react per hook "
"e icone, o un preset del bundler per Tailwind, Panda o MUI."

#: index.md:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "Generate for any platform"
msgstr "Genera per qualsiasi piattaforma"

#: index.md:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Install the pantoken cli to generate presets or add components for any "
"platform&colon; web, native, and anything in between."
msgstr ""

#: index.md:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "No React needed"
msgstr ""

#: index.md:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The InstUI library is tightly coupled with React. If you want to use it, you "
"have to use React. Now you can build anywhere."
msgstr ""

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "InstUI, everywhere"
#~ msgstr "InstUI, ovunque"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Every package reads the same resolved token IR. Change a token upstream "
#~ "and it flows to CSS, SCSS, native code, and Figma the same way."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Ogni pacchetto legge la stessa IR di token risolta. Modifica un token a "
#~ "monte e si propaga a CSS, SCSS, codice nativo e Figma allo stesso modo."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Run `pantoken generate` to emit Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, "
#~ "WordPress, and more. The same tokens, in each ecosystem's idiom."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Esegui `pantoken generate` per emettere Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, "
#~ "Rust, WordPress e altro. Gli stessi token, nell'idioma di ciascun "
#~ "ecosistema."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "No upstream coupling"
#~ msgstr "Nessun accoppiamento a monte"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "The tokens ship vendored as static JSON, so `npm i` never reaches for a "
#~ "GitHub-only source. Publishable, semver'd, offline-friendly."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "I token vengono forniti vendorizzati come JSON statico, quindi `npm i` "
#~ "non si appoggia mai a una sorgente disponibile solo su GitHub. "
#~ "Pubblicabile, versionato semver e compatibile offline."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "The package map"
#~ msgstr "La mappa dei pacchetti"
